# Threshold configuration for Synorix Suricata
# 
# Format: threshold gen_id <gid>, sig_id <sid>, type <threshold|limit>, track <by_src|by_dst>, count <c>, seconds <s>
#
# Examples:
# threshold gen_id 1, sig_id 1000001, type threshold, track by_src, count 5, seconds 60
# threshold gen_id 1, sig_id 1000002, type limit, track by_dst, count 1, seconds 300

# Reduce noise from common false positives
# threshold gen_id 1, sig_id 3000000, type threshold, track by_src, count 3, seconds 300
